       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CASECONVERSION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SOURCE-STR PIC X(20) VALUE "Hello World".
       01 UPPER-STR PIC X(20).
       01 LOWER-STR PIC X(20).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(SOURCE-STR) TO UPPER-STR
           MOVE FUNCTION LOWER-CASE(SOURCE-STR) TO LOWER-STR
           DISPLAY "UPPER: " UPPER-STR
           DISPLAY "LOWER: " LOWER-STR
           STOP RUN.
